{"name":"Highlighter","hex":"#ffe536","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"highlighter","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A marker pen used to highlight text.","A cosmetic product that reflects light, used to emphasize the contours of the face etc."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/highlighter"}],"entries":[{"title":"Highlighter","blocks":[{"text":"A highlighter, also called a fluorescent pen, is a type of writing device used to bring attention to sections of text by marking them with a vivid, translucent colour.\nA typical highlighter is fluorescent yellow, with the colour coming from pyranine. Different compounds, such as rhodamines are used for other colours."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highlighter","wikidata":"Q559350"},{"title":"Highlighter (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Highlighter is the eighth album by the People Under the Stairs, and the band's first released with Thes One's artist-cooperative label, Piecelock 70. With the exception of an iTunes-only EP, the album was released without accompanying singles or music videos. In the months following the release of Highlighter, PUTS embarked on yet another tour in support of the album."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b5/Putshighlighter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highlighter_(album)","wikidata":"Q17010022"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Markeerstift-01_%28xndr%29.jpg/500px-Markeerstift-01_%28xndr%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Markeerstift-01_%28xndr%29.jpg/1280px-Markeerstift-01_%28xndr%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Markeerstift-01_%28xndr%29.jpg/500px-Markeerstift-01_%28xndr